<title>DUBAI: German fuel venture Aral to open office in Dubai.</title>
<headline>German fuel venture Aral to open office in Dubai.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrol station chain Aral plans to open a regional office in the emirate of Dubai, the Dubai chamber of commerce and industry said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The office will cover operations in the Middle East, South Africa and the Indian sub-continent, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>It will appoint agents to market its products.</p>
<p>Aral is controlled by Mobil, German diversified industrial group Veba AG and Germany's Wintershall.</p>
</text>
